# Only what the Dockerfile copies is needed; keep the build context (and the Cloud Run source upload) small.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.venv
**/.env*
docs
mock-api
handover_docs
assets
tests
scripts
data/interim
data/processed
data/raw/angiocad
data/raw/uci_heart_disease
reports/eda
reports/figures
reports/phase*
reports/tabpfn
reports/autogluon
# Office lock files (a spreadsheet open in Excel) cannot be read and are never needed
**/~$*
